    Bug 1941386 - Handle chat core initialization after chat tab is open. r=aleca

    Based on the race identified in the bug. This makes sure we restore the conversations once the chat core is initialized.
    The tab being created early enough to also get notifications for the conversations is handled by addContact only adding
    every conversation exactly once.

    Lastly, sadly the test can't really cover the initialization case, so I've instead opted to at least test the after
    init case, which was working fine already.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D239154

